Third-party notices
====================

Cumulus://Mail can annotate a message with a country and a site category.
That path is off unless INFINITUM_GEO_ENABLED is set to 1, true, yes, or on.
Annotation does not change DMARC disposition, folder, or quarantine policy.
The binaries are not in git. `node scripts/fetch-geo-dat.mjs` downloads them
into data/geo/ after checking each official .sha256sum asset against
scripts/geo-dat.lock.json. A mismatch stops the download.

These sets are the v2fly releases named below. Loyalsoldier and sing-box
builds are GPL-3 and are not used.


